          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "demissão is a learned borrowing from Latin dīmissiō \"a sending out, a sending away\" (Lewis & Short), from dīmittere \"to send away\", built on mittere \"to send\"."
